{"type":"message","id":"b01bbfc7","parentId":"7eda7b74","timestamp":"2026-04-23T19:08:14.653Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-04-23 19:08 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: @Lucus 这是一个关于 **ECHO 势(Shi) 技术架构**的文档，总结如下： ## 核心概念 **「势」**是一个三维编织的动态系统，用时间、空间、关系三个维度配合64卦约束来管理数字资产。 ## 核心理念 - **实际生效配置** = 创作者意图 ∩ 物理法则范围 - **约束不是限制，而是生态的免疫系统** - 代码即法律，约束即保护，分叉即自由 ## 三维编织 | 维度 | 含义 | 档位 | |------|------|------| | 时间 | 活跃程度 |\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: Okay, we can't use sudo to install system dependencies. Let's try a different approach: first, let's see if we can fetch the page HTML using curl (this won't execute JS but will give us static content). Then we can look for other options. [conf\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Assistant: Okay, we can't use sudo to install system dependencies. Let's try a different approach: first, let's see if we can fetch the page HTML using curl (this won't execute JS but will give us static content). Then we can look for other options. [conf\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 73 memories."}],"timestamp":1776971294610}}
